Inject state into the root component's context.

# Example
```rust, no_run
use dioxus::prelude::*;
use std::any::Any;

#[derive(Clone)]
struct MyState {
    value: i32,
}

fn app() -> Element {
    rsx! {
        div { "Hello, world!" }
    }
}

dioxus::LaunchBuilder::new()
    .with_context(MyState { value: 42 })
    .launch(app);
```
